OL,3,AOutlander celebrated with special Bafta
OL,4,AScotland award
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe team behind the historic-fantasy TV
OL,7,Fseries Outlander are to be honoured by
OL,8,FBafta Scotland for their contributions
OL,9,Fto the industry.
OL,11,FSam Heughan, who played Jacobite
OL,12,Fsoldier Jamie Fraser, is one of four
OL,13,Fmembers of the show's production team
OL,14,Fwho will get the Outstanding
OL,15,FContribution to Television award at a
OL,16,Fceremony later this month.
OL,18,FOutlander ended in the summer after a
OL,19,F12-year run spanning eight seasons.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
