OL,3,AOutlander celebrated with special Bafta
OL,4,AScotland award
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe awards body said Outlander has had
OL,7,Fan "undeniable" impact on Scotland's
OL,8,Fscreen industry while also providing
OL,9,Fopportunities for local talent.
